#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.py:146
msgid "Show this dialog at startup"
msgstr "Amosar este diálogo no inicio"

#: generate_desktop_files:24 generate_desktop_files:37
msgid "Welcome Screen"
msgstr "Pantalla de benvida"

#: generate_desktop_files:24 generate_desktop_files:37
msgid "Introduction to Linux Mint"
msgstr "Introdución a Linux Mint"

#: generate_desktop_files:49
msgid "Install Multimedia Codecs"
msgstr "Instalar códecs multimedia"

#: generate_desktop_files:49
msgid "Add all the missing multimedia codecs"
msgstr "Engadir todos os códecs multimedia que falten"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:3
msgid ""
"Linux Mint is a great project. It is open to anyone who wants to "
"participate. There are many ways to help. Click the button below to see how "
"you can get involved."
msgstr ""
"Linux Mint é un gran proxecto, aberto a todas as persoas que queiran "
"participar. Hai moitas maneiras de colaborar. Prema o botón de abaixo para "
"descubrir como pode contribuír."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:4
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "Abrir"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:6
msgid ""
"The Linux Mint documentation consists of a collection of guides, available "
"in PDF, ePUB and HTML and available in many languages. Click the button "
"below to see which guides are available."
msgstr ""
"A documentación de Linux Mint está formada por unha colección de guías "
"dispoñíbeis en formato PDF, ePUB e HTML e en numerosas linguas. Prema o "
"botón de abaixo para consultar as guías dispoñíbeis."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:7
msgid "New Features"
msgstr "Novidades"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:8
msgid ""
"Click the button below to discover the new features introduced in this "
"version of Linux Mint."
msgstr ""
"Prema o botón de abaixo para descubrir as novas funcionalidades introducidas "
"nesta versión de Linux Mint."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:9
msgid "Release Notes"
msgstr "Notas da versión"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:10
msgid ""
"Click the button below to read about known bugs, limitations and workarounds "
"for this version of Linux Mint."
msgstr ""
"Prema o botón de abaixo para consultar os problemas coñecidos, as "
"limitacións e as medidas para evitalos nesta versión de Linux Mint."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:11
msgid "Desktop Colors"
msgstr "Cores do escritorio"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:12
msgid ""
"First, make yourself at home. Choose your favorite color and whether you "
"prefer a light or a dark desktop theme."
msgstr ""
"Para comezar, poña o escritorio ao seu gusto. Escolla a súa cor preferida e "
"decida se prefire un tema claro ou escuro."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:13
msgid "System Snapshots"
msgstr "Instantáneas do sistema"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:14
msgid ""
"Next, let's set automatic system snapshots. A minimum of two daily and two "
"boot snapshots are recommended. If anything breaks, you can then restore "
"your computer to its previous working state."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, imos configurar as instantáneas automáticas do sistema. "
"Recoméndase conservar polo menos dúas instantáneas diarias e dúas de "
"arranque. Se algo deixa de funcionar, poderá restaurar o equipo ao estado "
"anterior no que funcionaba correctamente."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:15
msgid "Driver Manager"
msgstr "Xestor de controladores"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:16
msgid ""
"Check the Driver Manager to see if it recommends any additional drivers for "
"your computer. Most hardware components are recognized by the Linux kernel "
"and work automatically without the need to install drivers. Some however "
"require proprietary drivers to be recognized or to work better."
msgstr ""
"Consulte o Xestor de controladores para comprobar se recomenda instalar "
"algún controlador adicional no seu equipo. O núcleo de Linux recoñece a "
"maioría dos compoñentes de hardware, que funcionan automaticamente sen "
"necesidade de instalar controladores. Porén, algúns precisan controladores "
"privativos para seren recoñecidos ou funcionaren mellor."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:17
msgid "Multimedia Codecs"
msgstr "Códecs multimedia"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:18
msgid ""
"Additional multimedia codecs are required to support some formats and to "
"play popular audio, video and web content. Click the button below to install "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Cómpre instalar códecs multimedia adicionais para admitir algúns formatos e "
"reproducir contidos habituais de audio, vídeo e da web. Prema o botón de "
"abaixo para instalalos."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:19
msgid "Update Manager"
msgstr "Xestor de actualizacións"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:20
msgid ""
"The little shield icon in your system tray is your Update Manager. It "
"provides software updates, security updates and kernel updates to fix bugs, "
"keep your computer safe and support newer hardware components."
msgstr ""
"A pequena icona en forma de escudo da área de notificacións corresponde ao "
"Xestor de actualizacións. Ofrece actualizacións de software, de seguridade e "
"do núcleo para corrixir erros, mellorar a seguridade do equipo e admitir "
"compoñentes de hardware máis recentes."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:21
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr "Configuración do sistema"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:22
msgid ""
"Have a look at the system settings and configure your operating system the "
"way you like. Don't hesitate to customize it and make it feel like home."
msgstr ""
"Examine a configuración do sistema e axuste o sistema operativo ao seu "
"gusto. Non dubide en personalizalo para que lle resulte cómodo e familiar."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:23
msgid "Software Manager"
msgstr "Xestor de software"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:24
msgid ""
"There are about 60,000 applications available. Linux Mint comes with the "
"bare minimum to get you started. The Software Manager is there if you're "
"looking for more."
msgstr ""
"Hai arredor de 60.000 aplicacións dispoñíbeis. Linux Mint inclúe o "
"imprescindible para comezar. Se quere instalar máis aplicacións, pode "
"utilizar o Xestor de software."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:25
msgid "Firewall"
msgstr "Devasa"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:26
msgid "Control and monitor network traffic by enabling the firewall."
msgstr "Controle e supervise o tráfico da rede activando a devasa."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:27
msgid "Web Forums"
msgstr "Foros na web"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:28
msgid ""
"The Linux Mint forums are the best place to find help. Join thousands of "
"users, search topics and threads and find solutions to your problems."
msgstr ""
"Os foros de Linux Mint son o mellor lugar para atopar axuda. Únase a "
"milleiros de persoas usuarias, busque temas e fíos de conversa e atope "
"solucións aos seus problemas."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:29
msgid "Chat Room"
msgstr "Sala de conversa"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:30
msgid ""
"You can also connect to Matrix and chat with users who are currently online. "
"Ask a question, maybe someone there knows the solution?"
msgstr ""
"Tamén pode conectarse a Matrix e conversar con outras persoas que están "
"conectadas neste momento. Faga unha pregunta: quizais alguén saiba como "
"resolvela."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:31
msgid ""
"Linux Mint has a great community. Many users will welcome you with open arms "
"and be delighted to help you. Make sure to be patient and respectful with "
"them. Keep a happy and positive attitude and provide accurate information "
"when someone helps you."
msgstr ""
"Linux Mint conta cunha gran comunidade. Moitas persoas usuarias recibirano "
"cos brazos abertos e estarán encantadas de axudarlle. Tráteas con paciencia "
"e respecto. Manteña unha actitude amable e positiva e facilite información "
"precisa cando reciba axuda."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:32
msgid ""
"If you have a bad experience with another user, try to solve it responsibly "
"or contact the moderation team. Although we can't guarantee everyone will "
"behave nicely, our project promotes help, respect, tolerance, ideas and "
"constructive discussions."
msgstr ""
"Se ten unha mala experiencia con outra persoa usuaria, tente resolvela de "
"maneira responsable ou póñase en contacto co equipo de moderación. Aínda que "
"non podemos garantir que todo o mundo se comporte de forma axeitada, o noso "
"proxecto fomenta a axuda mutua, o respecto, a tolerancia, o intercambio de "
"ideas e as conversas construtivas."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:33
msgid "Welcome to Linux Mint"
msgstr "Dámoslle a benvida a Linux Mint"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:34
msgid "Welcome to your new operating system!"
msgstr "Benvida ao seu novo sistema operativo!"

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:35
msgid ""
"This welcome screen will guide you through your first steps, show you how to "
"find help and where to get more information about Linux Mint."
msgstr ""
"Esta pantalla de benvida serviralle de guía nos primeiros pasos e amosaralle "
"como obter axuda e onde atopar máis información sobre Linux Mint."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:36
msgid ""
"On behalf of the development team and everyone involved in the project, we'd "
"like to thank you for choosing Linux Mint. We hope you'll enjoy using it as "
"much as we enjoy working on it."
msgstr ""
"En nome do equipo de desenvolvemento e de todas as persoas que participan no "
"proxecto, queremos darlle as grazas por escoller Linux Mint. Agardamos que "
"lle guste utilizalo tanto como a nós nos gusta traballar nel."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:37
msgid "Have a great time and don't hesitate to send us your feedback."
msgstr "Goce da experiencia e non dubide en enviarnos os seus comentarios."

#: usr/share/linuxmint/mintwelcome/mintwelcome.ui.h:38
msgid "Let's go!"
msgstr "Imos aló!"

